{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptDiagnosticsAndPerformance"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"ECS Integration","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS"],"anchor":"ECS-Integration"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptdiagnosticsandperformance"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Understand annotation, setup, and runtime failures and keep ECS work on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"native chunk path.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Compilation diagnostics","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Compilation-diagnostics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","type":"reference"},{"text":" compiles the source and reads declaration metadata","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without executing a ","type":"text"},{"code":"main()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" manifest. Initialization throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptError\/compilation(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" for syntax or semantic errors and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptError\/invalidManifest(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" for invalid AdaEngine annotations.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Examples include ","type":"text"},{"code":"@system","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on a non-class declaration, duplicate system","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identifiers, ","type":"text"},{"code":"@query","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" outside a system class, a query with no fetched","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"components, and a system class that cannot be initialized.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Setup diagnostics","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Setup-diagnostics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Native component identifiers are resolved during plugin setup so earlier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"plugins can register game components. Unknown or ambiguous component names skip","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the affected system and append a diagnostic.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Runtime diagnostics","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Runtime-diagnostics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Runtime diagnostics include unknown component aliases, unknown fields,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unsupported values, invalid numeric conversions, and query capabilities used","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"outside their callback lifetime.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Inspect ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin\/diagnostics","type":"reference"},{"text":" after setup and during development.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"System ","type":"text"},{"code":"update(context)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" callbacks are command-style; their return values are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ignored. Tests should assert observable ECS state and diagnostics.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Performance model","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Performance-model"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ada Script query execution traverses native archetypes and chunks. Component","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"columns are bound once per chunk, and field access advances a typed pointer by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"row stride. A successful write mutates the component in place and updates its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change tick.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The hot path avoids arrays of matched entity identifiers, one Swift bridge","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object per entity, repeated entity-location lookups, existential component","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"copies, and whole-component reinsertion.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The current embedded C runtime is globally shared and non-reentrant, so runtime entry remains","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"serialized. Scalability comes from native filtering, column iteration, cached","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"metadata, and narrow bridge calls rather than multiple concurrent VMs.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Benchmark scripting changes with multiple archetypes and chunks and compare","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them with a typed Swift query. Validate semantics before drawing performance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"conclusions.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"article","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Ada Script"}],"title":"Ada Script Diagnostics and Performance","role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"references":{"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptError/compilation(_:)":{"title":"AdaScriptError.compilation(_:)","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"compilation","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascripterro